  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You channel the pathos of the Shadowfell further through your fighting. The following effects join your Despairing Strike options.</p><p><strong>Apathetic.</strong> The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Incapacitated condition until the start of your next turn; while Incapacitated this way, it can give only one-word answers when spoken to.</p><p><strong>Lost.</strong> The target makes a Charisma saving throw. On a failure, it has the Blinded condition and its Speed is reduced to 0 until the end of its next turn; on a success, its Speed is halved until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Weary.</strong> The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or gain 1 Exhaustion level. This effect can't raise its Exhaustion level above 2, and Exhaustion levels gained this way are removed at the end of your next turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
